Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.47,0:00:08.18,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A forest tiger.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if I'm not wrong, this is...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.85,0:00:12.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a flower fairy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not from this area.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where could she come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.53,0:00:18.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll never get me!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.37,0:00:20.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bite!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.33,0:00:24.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not me...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I let you run now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.34,0:00:33.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What on earth did she want here?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.57,0:00:42.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.52,0:00:46.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.12,0:00:59.58,Episode title 14,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,0)\pos(384,590)}Flower fairy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.67,0:01:04.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't devour everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.32,0:01:05.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can eat only wood, you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.69,0:01:08.88,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She says you can't eat everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.64,0:01:10.41,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only wood.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.88,0:01:11.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The news of the Sky Pearl have already spread.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.00,0:01:15.67,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.14,0:01:17.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's already on the website.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.84,0:01:18.47,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Website?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.11,0:01:19.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.93,0:01:21.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only used by spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans can't reach it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.52,0:01:24.28,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's such a thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.73,0:01:26.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many spirits live in the human world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Members here are just a few of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.68,0:01:30.13,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so not the way I thought...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.53,0:01:32.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The human world affects spirits quite much.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.42,0:01:34.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a member-only board.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.88,0:01:36.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has about 3000 members,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's quite lively.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.49,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(78,48)}Books of Vows
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.21,0:01:38.31,Text E,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.73,0:01:41.15,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Look, it's here that the Sky Pearl quest was accomplished.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.15,0:01:41.97,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't read well.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(234,84)}Sky Pearl quest was accomplished
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,294)}Laozi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,194)}NC
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1000,378)}Holy crap, someone did this?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1000,490)}I've never thought this can be done!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1000,620)}Is this still your profile picture...?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,740)}Laozi!!!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,882)}Respect to the great deity!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.71,Text E,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,1020)}How's Diting doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.57,0:01:44.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was posted by Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.06,0:01:45.70,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does he have to post it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.98,0:01:47.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the rule.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.79,0:01:50.07,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vow quests{\i0} are well-known in the spirit community.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:51.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are even manuals for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.76,0:01:52.35,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manuals?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because the originals are complicated.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.80,0:01:59.04,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Look. They were published after\NMaster Lao stopped making vows.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(336,230)}Book of Vows 7
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,214)}Complete Collection of\NBooks of Vows
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1202,218)}Collection of Twelve\N(complete)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1638,218)}Collection of Twelve\N(complete)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFE&\pos(250,560)}Compa{\3c&HE5EAE9&}ss to the\N{\3c&HFEFEFE&}Collection{\3c&HE5EAE9&} of Twelve
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716,560)}Collection of Twelve\N(Blue Creek version)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1176,558)}Experiences of\NQuest-Doers
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1650,562)}These You Should Do Again:\NQuests to Revisit
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(132,996)}Unaccomplished\NQuests
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(638,998)}Simple Quests
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1146,998)}Book of Vows 3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.65,Text E4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1666,998)}Book of Vows (old)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are 12 books of vows without the manuals.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.91,0:02:03.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Together the Collection of Twelve.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.65,0:02:04.45,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So many of them...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.81,0:02:06.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many people follow these posts.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.01,0:02:07.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see my point?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.80,0:02:09.49,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.49,0:02:10.30,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,someone can take the prize away?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.77,0:02:11.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's easier than to go to Master Lao's.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the fairy from yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.86,0:02:34.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want here?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.60,0:02:36.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll never know! Kill me if you want!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.80,0:02:37.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.77,0:02:38.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spare me, my lord.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.39,0:02:43.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a cure for my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I felt the movement of special spirit force here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.12,0:02:46.91,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fairy sense!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.15,0:02:48.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite a rare skill.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.70,0:02:50.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.05,0:02:52.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Fenmo.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a lovely little flower fairy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't harm people.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.18,0:02:56.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are spirits too.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.07,0:03:01.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.82,0:03:02.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm human.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.80,0:03:04.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a lovely little flower fairy...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.69,0:03:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with your friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.45,0:03:09.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's gravely ill.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.46,0:03:10.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's fast asleep and won't wake up.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is why you came?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.43,0:03:15.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.05,0:03:18.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the thing you felt can't cure illnesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.31,0:03:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could take me to your friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can help him.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.44,0:03:22.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soul Wind Mountain?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.93,0:03:27.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a long way from here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder I've never met you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.81,0:03:30.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you found anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.70,0:03:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some de-souling grass.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.46,0:03:34.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think it helps here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can go there right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.49,0:03:36.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.44,0:03:51.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fairy dragon...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.24,0:03:54.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So there are fairies that big around here...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.52,0:03:56.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't take us all.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should wait us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.21,0:03:59.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.54,0:03:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I put Piyu in his cage?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.39,0:04:03.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.61,0:04:04.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Piyu will be a good boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.73,0:04:05.74,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be good, no roughhousing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.57,0:04:08.37,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to say so.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.87,0:04:10.83,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's a Heishu to keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.25,0:04:11.83,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us out, Xiaolong.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.00,0:04:14.37,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.31,0:04:25.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unconscious for a month?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.78,0:04:26.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he a flower fairy too?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, he's a tree fairy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.26,0:04:31.95,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,How can a fairy be in a coma for such a long time?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.47,0:04:33.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! This is the place!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.53,0:04:37.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.51,0:04:39.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.11,0:04:41.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaolong, you can go back now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.49,0:04:43.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll call you when we're done here.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.62,0:04:52.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's lively here.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.90,0:04:53.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.88,0:04:57.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's he?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.92,0:04:58.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.70,0:04:59.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring him outside!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.24,0:05:06.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's he?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you done?!!!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.81,0:05:22.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiguo! You got better!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.60,0:05:29.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are two souls in his body.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of them is very weak,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.79,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,and the other one obviously doesn't belong there.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.57,0:05:38.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could be that...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.34,0:05:40.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he is not your friend anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.73,0:05:46.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finish it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.85,0:05:48.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to Qiguo?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.26,0:05:49.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.06,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spirit trap is launching.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.27,0:05:52.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.47,0:05:55.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.70,0:05:56.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.11,0:05:59.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A giantifying trap?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.93,0:06:06.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.69,0:06:09.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why run away, after we fell in his trap?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.00,0:06:14.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.92,0:06:24.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.97,0:07:11.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys shrinked...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.48,0:07:12.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my fault...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.92,0:07:13.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.03,0:07:14.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} wasn't cautious.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could he set up such a strong trap?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I not shrinked?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.28,0:07:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yours is a fairy body.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These traps only affect material sprites.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.67,0:07:30.10,Episode title 15,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(1366,574)}Soul Wind Mountain
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.36,0:07:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And how will you turn back?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will wear off after some time.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't know exactly, when.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Qiguo?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.71,0:07:33.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he's already...?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.02,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two souls depend on each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.22,0:07:35.66,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiguo must be still alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.76,0:07:36.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.86,0:07:37.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.65,0:07:38.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we need to hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must find him quickly.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he seemed to be so strong...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.08,0:07:43.59,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This trap wasn't set up just now.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.11,0:07:44.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.01,0:07:46.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must have been prepared beforehand.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.31,0:07:49.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If someone could do this in a second,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it would be terrible...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.64,0:07:53.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He didn't attack when the trap got us.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if he has bad intentions,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.25,0:07:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he is still very weak.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.11,0:07:57.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you trace him?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.98,0:07:59.54,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to take the trouble!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can't sense within 500 yards!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.59,0:08:05.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sense!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.30,0:08:07.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's out of range...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.32,0:08:10.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would run away {\i1}within{\i0} 500 yards?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.09,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my turn.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.84,0:08:12.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.34,0:08:18.03,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't summon Xiaolong...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.24,0:08:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you'll see what I can do!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here comes the king of the jungle!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.90,0:08:33.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there another one?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, we can look for him slowly...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.29,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.26,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei-shu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.97,0:08:47.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You let loose a bunch of mosquitoes...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.89,0:08:48.29,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.35,0:08:58.94,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.09,0:08:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.09,0:09:03.82,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.71,0:09:05.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll carry her.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.98,0:09:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so light!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.90,0:09:12.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.17,0:09:13.63,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was light a moment ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true we now weigh less,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.55,0:09:21.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it seems our stamina decreased too.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also we got a lot smaller...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.87,0:09:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One mile now feels like it was 20 times more.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.27,0:09:27.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't catch up by ourselves.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should get something to ride on.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.98,0:09:32.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.63,0:09:38.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels even slower...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.99,0:09:48.84,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Heishus left us well behind.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.16,0:09:50.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope they'll soon find him...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.09,0:09:51.81,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fairies never get tired.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.22,0:09:53.04,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he stopped somewhere?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.43,0:09:54.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's in a bad condition.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.91,0:09:56.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He needs a place to regenerate.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.74,0:09:57.25,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But no idea how far away.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.88,0:10:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A carnivorous squirrel?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can ride it!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just scared it away.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.11,0:10:07.42,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fast! Let's find another one!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.79,0:10:08.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.04,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.76,0:10:12.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it fast?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.47,0:10:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.09,0:10:17.87,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll give us a ride!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.92,0:10:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be faster.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.93,0:10:19.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least less tiring.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.04,0:10:23.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's find something else...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.39,0:10:23.98,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.19,0:10:24.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.59,0:10:27.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.01,0:10:33.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gee.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spirit space?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.59,0:11:04.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One-way gravity?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.43,0:11:07.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't go on anymore!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.61,0:11:09.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.86,0:11:12.71,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Don't compare a preteen human's flesh-and-blood body to a fairy's.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get some food...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.18,0:11:16.94,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Heishus can't find more traces.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.94,0:11:17.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.82,0:11:20.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's eat first...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.83,0:11:21.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gaping mushroom.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.75,0:11:23.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It gives you a terrible diarrhea.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.63,0:11:24.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.86,0:11:25.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bud-sucking caterpillar.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nutritious and really tasty.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.22,0:11:27.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.30,0:11:29.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cloud mushroom.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hard as steel, used for making tools.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.45,0:11:32.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.88,0:11:33.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.32,0:11:34.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.83,0:11:35.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.43,0:11:36.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.99,0:11:38.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exploding chrysanthemum.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pollen bursts out of it on touch.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.74,0:11:42.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It makes animals pollinate it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.43,0:11:44.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But its fruit is edible.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.16,0:11:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Much faster now.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.99,0:12:08.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.55,0:12:10.27,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei-shu!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.83,0:12:11.49,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He left traces all along,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.49,0:12:12.13,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and there was always a next one.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.31,0:12:12.84,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But now there's none.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.54,0:12:14.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he must be nearby.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.31,0:12:16.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we need your help.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.48,0:12:26.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you find him?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can feel him all around, though weakly.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must have scattered his body.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he roughly?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.78,0:12:32.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll force him to show up.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.94,0:12:33.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.18,0:12:38.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are these the places?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.56,0:12:40.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I feel him at those places.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.81,0:13:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stronger than I expected...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.01,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You're strong without being integrated to that body.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.29,0:13:34.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were in your own body,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.79,0:13:36.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I weren't a match for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.31,0:13:38.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you realized it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.90,0:13:41.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't attack us when we fell in your trap.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.77,0:13:43.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe we are no enemies.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we help you with something?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.80,0:13:47.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The tree fairy who you possess,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will die very soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.60,0:13:54.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want me to give my life up for this fairy?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.28,0:13:55.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm offering you a tree type soul core.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a tempting offer indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.04,0:14:06.86,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But my soul found this body\Nafter three years of wandering.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.52,0:14:08.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't take risks again.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.07,0:14:10.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guarantee the soul core is just fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.03,0:14:11.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could I make you trust me?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.59,Episode title 16,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,0)\pos(490,614)}Immortal and Fairy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.91,0:14:16.23,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Why would I put my life\Nin the hands of a stranger?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.58,0:14:18.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.32,0:14:19.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can't persuade him,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.54,0:14:20.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll need your help.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.69,0:14:22.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.70,0:14:27.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.79,0:14:37.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to kill him?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.14,0:14:46.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange... Where did this attack come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.73,0:14:49.44,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Now you can't scatter\Nnor regenerate your body, can you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.97,0:14:51.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.41,0:14:53.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weird question to ask during a fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.73,0:14:54.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.87,0:14:57.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,one more hit like that, and you'll meet your end.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.84,0:15:02.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.26,0:15:04.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.14,0:15:07.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My spirit space!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.37,0:15:09.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's rude to leave like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.45,0:15:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You let me into your space too easily.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.37,0:15:19.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.08,0:15:22.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you are willing to leave this body now,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my offer is still valid.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll never accept it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.51,0:15:29.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't force you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The least that I can.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.94,0:15:39.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send you to the next life.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.61,0:15:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you kill him in the end?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.41,0:15:42.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Technically, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For you I can't do any more.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.62,0:15:45.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fairy's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you won't do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.54,0:15:50.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do you get that baseless trust from?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.78,0:15:52.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just entrusted with this.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose the soul core either.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.69,0:15:58.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's just a mere fairy.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.21,0:15:59.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I die, you'll stay like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.93,0:16:03.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't lock me up in your spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.48,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Especially that it becomes ownerless after you die.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.80,0:16:07.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.79,0:16:08.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll consider your offer!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.40,0:16:12.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.14,0:16:14.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I accept it! I accept it!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.91,0:16:21.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.23,0:16:23.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.83,0:16:27.32,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.96,0:16:36.65,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,I've never thought you can move\Nto a plant within such a short time.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.26,0:16:43.33,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Should I destroy your new place, or will you appear by yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.57,0:16:46.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have to kill off everything around you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.82,0:16:48.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you please revert the magic first?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I can't summon the soul core.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.19,0:16:55.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just killed the tree fairy!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could I believe you have a soul core?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.65,0:16:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, that tree fairy...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.91,0:17:00.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've saved him.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.06,0:17:01.59,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fenmo!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.35,0:17:03.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.30,0:17:04.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's this possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.13,0:17:05.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's space type...?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.27,0:17:10.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must say you made a complete fool out of me...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.31,0:17:13.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We had to hurry, please forgive us.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.24,0:17:18.11,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,What if I hadn't left that body even at the risk of death?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be back at square one, wouldn't we?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.13,0:17:28.94,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're back to normal.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.35,0:17:29.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.47,0:17:32.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You left me no choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.81,0:17:36.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A tree type soul core!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really offer it to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.35,0:17:39.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid it's a fake?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.13,0:17:42.67,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't go that far\Njust to destroy a roaming soul.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.85,0:17:43.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I accept it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.87,0:17:50.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm finally revived!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.54,0:18:02.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a good body indeed!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.72,0:18:04.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotten much stronger now.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid I'll attack you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You couldn't trust me first,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.86,0:18:10.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I have to trust you first.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.46,0:18:13.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name, son?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.71,0:18:16.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can call me Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Muluo, I am an immortal.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.61,0:18:21.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are Muluo...?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shame on you!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.51,0:18:23.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't toy with our lives!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.55,0:18:27.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.75,0:18:29.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am ashamed of myself...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.43,0:18:31.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I take whatever punishment you see fit.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.16,0:18:32.82,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.58,0:18:34.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would {\i1}you{\i0} have done?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.85,0:18:40.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have sacrificed Qiguo to save myself!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.93,0:18:44.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what if it wasn't Qiguo,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.94,0:18:46.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but those two ladybugs?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.59,0:18:55.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.02,0:18:57.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.06,0:18:59.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't be compared...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.73,0:19:00.86,Main Dialogue Right,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with ladybugs?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.18,0:19:00.86,Main Dialogue Left,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.55,0:19:03.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'd have done the same...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course you wouldn't...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.34,0:19:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no right to condemn you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to make up for it,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.77,0:19:10.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ask Qiguo when he wakes up.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.20,0:19:11.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.72,0:19:13.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's best this way.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.23,0:19:15.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I leave things here to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must leave now, Gen?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.97,0:19:18.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.63,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,{\c&d7d7d7&}This is a mud ball I made.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my soul stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's worth far less than the soul core.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my spirit space abilities are in it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.17,0:19:31.40,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,If you ever need my help, you can call me with this.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.97,0:19:32.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I gladly accept it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.79,0:19:36.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.89,0:19:38.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will take care of the two.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.61,0:19:42.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll visit you when Qiguo's recovered.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.04,0:19:43.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can go back too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.46,0:19:55.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not angry with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.79,0:19:56.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.23,0:19:58.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are a lovely little fairy.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.19,0:20:01.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be my disciple?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.13,0:20:03.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.01,0:20:03.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.27,0:20:08.41,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we leave the fairies to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, Muluo is a high-ranking immortal.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.59,0:20:13.43,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if it's not really him?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.09,0:20:15.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's him.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was he wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.99,0:20:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not so easy to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.86,0:20:23.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An immortal and a fairy...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.29,0:20:24.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a human being and a sparrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.15,0:20:26.29,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So a sparrow's life's worth nothing?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.37,0:20:28.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The immortal can be the sparrow, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.19,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.61,0:20:32.27,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prolongation of life always requires sacrifices.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.15,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you don't want to live?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.53,0:20:39.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll cherish life even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:32.66,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:37.40,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:42.10,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:48.30,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:54.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:59.25,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:03.93,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.93,0:22:10.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:21.77,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:27.19,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:32.23,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.23,0:22:43.46,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:49.01,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:55.85,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
